      "updated": 1795110717545,
      "created": 1795038358919,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Technologies:\n- Extract VIN/mileage from photos with Tesseract + Optical\nCharacter Recognition (OCP)\n- S3 for blob storage\n- FastAPI + Uvicorn + SQLAlchemy + Pydantic backend\n- Pytest for backend unit tests\n- React + Vite + TS frontend \n- Vitest for frontend unit tests\n- Monitoring?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Technologies:\n- Extract VIN/mileage from photos with Tesseract + Optical Character Recognition (OCP)\n- S3 for blob storage\n- FastAPI + Uvicorn + SQLAlchemy + Pydantic backend\n- Pytest for backend unit tests\n- React + Vite + TS frontend \n- Vitest for frontend unit tests\n- Monitoring?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
